WEBVTT

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:13.072
Oh, my gosh!

00:00:13.239 --> 00:00:15.616
I thought you guys said you were musicians!

00:00:17.034 --> 00:00:19.912
Ash, babe. I'm the lead singer, okay?

00:00:19.995 --> 00:00:21.163
Just stick to the backing vocals.

00:00:21.247 --> 00:00:22.832
Sorry, I get carried away.

00:00:22.915 --> 00:00:24.416
Yeah, I know, right?

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:26.669
It just kind of ruins my song, you know?

00:00:31.006 --> 00:00:34.844
(FAMILY SINGING)

00:00:42.143 --> 00:00:44.728
(SINGING SOULFULLY)

00:00:51.777 --> 00:00:52.862
(GASPS)

00:00:52.945 --> 00:00:54.113
MEENA'S MOTHER
AND GRANDMOTHER: Aww!

00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:55.656
(CHUCKLES) What?

00:00:55.739 --> 00:00:57.032
Come on, make your wish.

00:00:57.741 --> 00:01:01.453
Hmm! I wish you'd join a choir.
A local band, or something.

00:01:01.954 --> 00:01:03.455
-I tried!
-Bah!

00:01:03.539 --> 00:01:05.374
Hey, hey, Dad! We've been over this.

00:01:05.457 --> 00:01:07.793
So she's a little shy. So what?

00:01:07.877 --> 00:01:12.464
If I had a voice like Meena's,
I'd be a superstar by now!

00:01:12.548 --> 00:01:13.716
Just singing...

00:01:13.799 --> 00:01:14.925
(VOCALIZING)

00:01:15.009 --> 00:01:18.262
Sure you would, Grandpa.
Now blow out your candles.

00:01:18.345 --> 00:01:19.346
(SCOFFS)

00:01:19.722 --> 00:01:20.723
(TRUMPETS)

00:01:24.685 --> 00:01:26.520
(PLAYING JAZZ MUSIC)

00:01:33.152 --> 00:01:34.236
(COIN CLINKS)

00:01:35.654 --> 00:01:36.739
A penny?

00:01:36.822 --> 00:01:37.907
How dare you!

00:01:38.073 --> 00:01:40.242
I happen to have studied
at the Lincoln School of Music!

00:01:40.534 --> 00:01:42.119
Sorry, it's all I got right now.

00:01:42.703 --> 00:01:44.163
Oh, is that so?

00:01:44.246 --> 00:01:45.247
(GRUNTS)

00:01:46.373 --> 00:01:47.917
-All right, prove it, pal!
-What?

00:01:48.083 --> 00:01:49.084
Empty your pockets right now!

00:01:49.335 --> 00:01:50.336
(SIGHS) Trying to find...

00:01:50.711 --> 00:01:52.421
-What is this you got here?
-I'm just trying to find...

00:01:52.504 --> 00:01:53.547
What do you smoke out of this?

00:01:53.672 --> 00:01:55.466
(STRAINED BREATHING) That's my inhaler.

00:01:56.258 --> 00:01:58.385
A-ha! I knew it!

00:01:58.969 --> 00:02:01.513
You all saw it!
You all saw it right here! The monkey lied!

00:02:01.597 --> 00:02:02.598
(ALL GASP)

00:02:02.681 --> 00:02:03.891
I forgot I had that. (CLEARS THROAT)

00:02:04.058 --> 00:02:05.184
And next time,

00:02:05.267 --> 00:02:06.268
pick on someone your own size!

00:02:06.393 --> 00:02:07.394
(INHALES DEEPLY)

00:02:07.478 --> 00:02:08.896
You bully!

00:02:08.979 --> 00:02:10.147
(CONTINUES PLAYING JAZZ MUSIC)

00:02:16.737 --> 00:02:17.947
(HORN HONKING)

00:02:18.739 --> 00:02:20.366
(SIGHS) Take care of her, will you?

00:02:20.449 --> 00:02:23.702
She may look old and rusty,
but she is a classic!

00:02:25.663 --> 00:02:27.665
(CLASSICAL MUSIC PLAYING)

00:02:29.875 --> 00:02:31.710
Okay, listen. We both know that my theater

00:02:31.794 --> 00:02:34.129
has been going through
some pretty rough times lately.

00:02:34.213 --> 00:02:38.217
But as the saying goes,
"For every cloud, a silver lining." We've got...

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:39.718
(TUTTING) Hold on right there, Buster.

00:02:39.885 --> 00:02:42.680
My dad, he heard I was
gonna see you today and he was all like,

00:02:42.763 --> 00:02:45.683
"Eddie, you tell that koala
I'm not funding any more of those shows.

00:02:45.766 --> 00:02:47.017
"And that's final." Those were his words.

00:02:47.101 --> 00:02:49.853
Your dad's right.
Those shows were the problem.

00:02:49.937 --> 00:02:51.897
War of Attrition. Rosie Takes a Bow.

00:02:51.981 --> 00:02:53.816
I mean, nobody wants
to see that stuff anymore.

00:02:53.899 --> 00:02:55.150
So, what do I do?

00:02:55.567 --> 00:02:57.111
-Quit?
-No.

00:02:57.194 --> 00:03:00.155
I give them a show
they cannot resist, which is gonna be...

00:03:00.239 --> 00:03:01.198
Ahem!

00:03:01.282 --> 00:03:03.075
Just one more minute, s'il vous plaît.

00:03:03.158 --> 00:03:05.077
-(GRUMBLES)
-Merci!

00:03:05.411 --> 00:03:07.371
Don't speak French. They speak English here.

00:03:07.538 --> 00:03:09.498
Now, my next show is gonna be...

00:03:09.581 --> 00:03:10.791
Drumroll, please.

00:03:10.874 --> 00:03:12.293
(IMITATING DRUMROLL)

00:03:12.459 --> 00:03:14.336
A singing competition!

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:16.630
A singing competition?

00:03:16.964 --> 00:03:18.257
Who wants to see another one of those?

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:20.259
Everyone! Just... Just think.

00:03:20.342 --> 00:03:24.305
Your neighbor, the grocery store manager,
that chicken! Right there!

00:03:24.388 --> 00:03:27.516
Everyone in this city
gets a shot at being a star

00:03:27.599 --> 00:03:29.059
live on my stage!

00:03:29.143 --> 00:03:31.312
Buster, this is a terrible idea!

00:03:31.437 --> 00:03:32.730
Oh! No, it's not!

00:03:32.813 --> 00:03:34.898
Real talent from real life.

00:03:34.982 --> 00:03:38.110
That's what audiences want,
and I'm gonna give it to them!

00:03:38.235 --> 00:03:39.570
All right, well...

00:03:40.529 --> 00:03:41.613
(STAMMERS) Can we please
just get out of here?

00:03:41.739 --> 00:03:42.781
Don't you wanna eat?

00:03:42.865 --> 00:03:44.825
Yeah, but we can't afford any of this.

00:03:44.908 --> 00:03:47.036
Yes, I know, and that's why...

00:03:47.119 --> 00:03:48.287
I brought sandwiches.

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:51.999
Uh, that's not allowed. And... Ugh!

00:03:52.082 --> 00:03:53.500
BUSTER: What, you don't like
peanut butter and jelly?

00:03:53.584 --> 00:03:54.710
Excuse me, sir.

00:03:55.377 --> 00:03:57.338
Okay, look, I got cream cheese,
I got banana... (YELPS)

00:03:57.504 --> 00:03:58.547
(GROANS)

00:03:59.548 --> 00:04:00.549
(SPUTTERS)

00:04:02.551 --> 00:04:03.552
You okay?

00:04:03.635 --> 00:04:05.012
Yup. Never better.

00:04:08.265 --> 00:04:09.516
BUSTER: (ON INTERCOM) Miss Crawly?

00:04:10.559 --> 00:04:12.102
Hello? (EXCLAIMS)

00:04:12.186 --> 00:04:14.146
Uh, who is it?

00:04:14.313 --> 00:04:15.606
It's me. (CLEARS THROAT)

00:04:15.689 --> 00:04:17.274
Your boss. Mr. Moon.

00:04:17.399 --> 00:04:19.651
-Oh, hello, Mr. Moon.
-There we go.

00:04:19.735 --> 00:04:22.946
Now, I need you to add the following
information to our publicity flyers.

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:24.031
Yes, sir.

00:04:24.114 --> 00:04:28.035
The winner of the singing contest
will receive a grand prize of...

00:04:28.994 --> 00:04:31.538
$935.

00:04:31.705 --> 00:04:34.500
Hmm. Gonna need
more than that. Just a second.

00:04:37.711 --> 00:04:39.380
Uh, there.

00:04:39.755 --> 00:04:42.049
(GRUNTS) $1,000.

00:04:42.216 --> 00:04:45.386
-You got that?
-$1,000.

00:04:45.469 --> 00:04:46.929
Oh!

00:04:53.769 --> 00:04:55.813
BUSTER: Print them up
on every single sheet of paper we have left,

00:04:55.896 --> 00:04:58.273
and let's spread the word right away, okay?

00:04:58.357 --> 00:04:59.525
(STAMMERS) Oh, yes, sir.

00:05:03.404 --> 00:05:05.823
Okay. Come on out of there.

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:12.913
(INHALES DEEPLY)

00:05:12.996 --> 00:05:16.250
Ah, the winds of change.

00:05:16.375 --> 00:05:20.129
Yep, when this show's a hit,
I'm gonna get you a fresh coat of paint.

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:22.881
How are we doing
with those flyers, Miss Crawly?

00:05:22.965 --> 00:05:26.009
Oh, yes, sir. We're all good to go here.

00:05:26.093 --> 00:05:27.136
-(WIND WHOOSHES)
-Whoa...

00:05:27.219 --> 00:05:29.138
Miss Crawly, no! No, no, no!

00:05:30.472 --> 00:05:31.849
MISS CRAWLY: Oopsie-daisy.

00:05:31.932 --> 00:05:34.893
(SIGHS) Well, I guess
that's one way to spread the word.

00:05:41.733 --> 00:05:43.110
(ANIMALS GASPING)

00:05:49.825 --> 00:05:51.201
Hey, Lance, look at this!

00:05:51.702 --> 00:05:52.870
Ash, babe. Hey!

00:05:55.831 --> 00:05:56.999
(SIRENS WAILING)

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:04.590
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:06.925
(HUMMING)

00:06:07.009 --> 00:06:08.051
MEENA'S GRANDMOTHER: Meena!

00:06:11.805 --> 00:06:13.807
(MIKE PLAYING JAZZ MUSIC
ON SAXOPHONE)

00:06:14.641 --> 00:06:15.767
(PLAYS OFF-KEY NOTE)

00:06:15.893 --> 00:06:17.019
Hey, hey, hey! What do you think you're...

00:06:19.062 --> 00:06:20.481
Uh-huh. Yeah.

